<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rapport Réservations - PsyDesk</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .page {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            page-break-after: always;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #667eea;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px #ccc;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .generated-date {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .summary-grid {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-spacing: 15px;
            border-collapse: separate;
        }

        .summary-row {
            display: table-row;
        }

        .summary-box {
            display: table-cell;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 25%;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .summary-box.pending {
            border-left-color: #f59e0b;
        }

        .summary-box.confirmed {
            border-left-color: #10b981;
        }

        .summary-box.cancelled {
            border-left-color: #ef4444;
        }

        .summary-value {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .summary-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #33f;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px #ccc;
            font-size: 24px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #667eea;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #dddddd;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .badge-pending {
            background: #fff3cd;
            color: #856404;
        }

        .badge-confirmed {
            background: #d4edda;
            color: #155724;
        }

        .badge-cancelled {
            background: #f8d7da;
            color: #721c24;
        }

        .patient-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333;
        }

        .patient-email {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .doctor-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #667eea;
        }

        .date-time {
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 12px;
            border-top: 2px solid #ddd;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .no-data {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #999;
            font-style: italic;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="generated-date">
            Généré le: {{ 'now'|date('d/m/Y à H:i:s') }}
        </div>

        <h1>🧠 PsyDesk</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Rapport Complet des Réservations</div>

        <!-- Statistics Summary -->
        {% if reservations|length > 0 %}
            {% set total = reservations|length %}
            {% set pending = 0 %}
            {% set confirmed = 0 %}
            {% set cancelled = 0 %}

            {% for res in reservations %}
                {% if res.status == 'en attente' %}
                    {% set pending = pending + 1 %}
                {% elseif res.status == 'confirmé' %}
                    {% set confirmed = confirmed + 1 %}
                {% elseif res.status == 'annulé' %}
                    {% set cancelled = cancelled + 1 %}
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}

            <div class="summary-grid">
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <div class="summary-box">
                        <div class="summary-value">{{ total }}</div>
                        <div class="summary-label">Total</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-box pending">
                        <div class="summary-value" style="color: #f59e0b;">{{ pending }}</div>
                        <div class="summary-label">En Attente</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-box confirmed">
                        <div class="summary-value" style="color: #10b981;">{{ confirmed }}</div>
                        <div class="summary-label">Confirmées</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-box cancelled">
                        <div class="summary-value" style="color: #ef4444;">{{ cancelled }}</div>
                        <div class="summary-label">Annulées</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <!-- Reservations Table -->
        <h2>📋 Liste des Réservations</h2>

        {% if reservations|length > 0 %}
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Patient</th>
                        <th>Email</th>
                        <th>Psychologue</th>
                        <th>Date/Heure</th>
                        <th>Disponibilité</th>
                        <th>Statut</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for reservation in reservations %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                {% if reservation.patient %}
                                    <div class="patient-name">{{ reservation.patient.prenom }} {{ reservation.patient.nom }}</div>
                                {% else %}
                                    <span style="color: #999;">N/A</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                {% if reservation.patient %}
                                    <div class="patient-email">{{ reservation.patient.email }}</div>
                                {% else %}
                                    <span style="color: #999;">N/A</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                {% if reservation.psychologue %}
                                    <div class="doctor-name">Dr. {{ reservation.psychologue.prenom }} {{ reservation.psychologue.nom }}</div>
                                {% else %}
                                    <span style="color: #999;">N/A</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td class="date-time">
                                {% if reservation.datePrevue %}
                                    {{ reservation.datePrevue|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}
                                {% else %}
                                    <span style="color: #999;">-</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td class="date-time">
                                {% if reservation.dateDispo %}
                                    {{ reservation.dateDispo|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}
                                {% else %}
                                    <span style="color: #999;">-</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                {% if reservation.status == 'en attente' %}
                                    <span class="badge badge-pending">⏳ En Attente</span>
                                {% elseif reservation.status == 'confirmé' %}
                                    <span class="badge badge-confirmed">✅ Confirmée</span>
                                {% elseif reservation.status == 'annulé' %}
                                    <span class="badge badge-cancelled">❌ Annulée</span>
                                {% else %}
                                    <span class="badge">{{ reservation.status }}</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        {% else %}
            <div class="no-data">
                Aucune réservation disponible
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Ce document est confidentiel et réservé aux professionnels de santé autorisés.</p>
            <p>&copy; 2026 PsyDesk - Tous droits réservés</p>
            <p>Plateforme de gestion pour psychologues et patients</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
